        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Adena Friedman\n- Companies: The Carlyle Group, Nasdaq, Inc.\n- Roles: managing director, CFO, president, chief executive officer\n- Topics: private equity, alternative asset management, financial services\n\nFacts:\n- Adena T. Friedman was born in 1969 and is an American businessperson.\n- Adena Friedman was formerly the managing director and CFO of The Carlyle Group.\n- The Carlyle Group is an American multinational private equity, alternative asset management, and financial services corporation.\n- The Carlyle Group is one of the largest private equity and alternative investment firms in the world.\n- The Carlyle Group specializes in corporate private equity, real assets, global market strategies, and investment solutions.\n- Nasdaq, Inc. is headquartered in New York City.\n- Nasdaq, Inc.'s president and chief executive officer is Adena Friedman.",
